  <item>
    <coll>Gtn</coll>
    <ref>Gtn005.016</ref>
    <rnb>101</rnb>
    <tib>rdo rje srin po rno ba rdo rje mchu can gyi rgyud zhes bya ba rgyud thams cad kyi snying po/ 'khor ba dong sprugs chen po'i rgyud</tib>
    <skt>badzra rak+Sha tsid+ha badzra mu ta ra tan+t+ra na ma ma</skt>
    <coloph>mkhas pa'i mkhas pa bla ma dam pa'i gdams ngag la/ /dka' dang sdos nas don gyi man ngag btsal/ /rdo rje gdan nas shrI sid+has gnang/ /rang gi rgyud sbyangs 'gro ba'i don byas nas/ /sangs rgyas thugs kyi dgongs pas ma nor rgyud/ /thugs kyi klong nas bcud gsum spros pa ni/ /byang chub sems dpa' re re'i don du bzhag/ rgyud kyi snying po man ngag gzer bzhi po/ /sde dang tshoms su bcad nas rgya yis btab/ /'chi med bdud rtsi thig le nyag gcigo /rdo rje gdan gyi 'og nas bzhes pa 'di/ /rgyud rgyal rtsad po'i don du shrI sing has gnang bsku drin che/ /bod kyi chos lugs ngan pas slar gter du sbos/ zhes bi ma' la mi tras gdams pa rdzogso</coloph>
